;; The graphs a Studio seeded from this model starts with (doc 104 §8.17.6,
;; OQ-STUDIO-SEED). One graph over the whole DVD store: it is the example a
;; person meets first, and splitting it would make the first screen an exercise
;; in navigation rather than a business.
;;
;; `:package-name` is the RELEASE name its cut versions are sealed under
;; (doc 104 §8.17.7 D) — the qualified name is `<login workspace>/dvd`, which on
;; a personal workspace is an email address and cannot be a package name.
[{:name "dvd" :selectors ["dvd.*"] :package-name "open-atlas/dvd"}]
